      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3f34e2f6",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "general public",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general audience familiar with the 'March of Progress' evolution graphic and the cultural stereotype of pigs as symbols of gluttony and moral decay. It targets individuals who engage in or are aware of dietary choices and health discussions, using humor and shock value to provoke reaction.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
